# Ash on the grass (grass.gdshader, slice 4), where it can lie on it: the ash
# half of tours/foliage_snow_ash.tour, on its own seed because the two need
# different worlds. Seed 7's burning grows 1,435 tiles of grass (2026-09-26),
# where seed 1's, the snow tour's, grows 44.
# A dry frame beside an ashen one of the same place and hour, over the
# shoulder; `perf blades` gives the colour of only the blades: ash must take
# their colour. `near ash_meadow` (18_trample) stands where the most of it lies.
#   tools/tour.sh tours/foliage_ash.tour --seed=7
# Options: --seed=7
hour 11
coast calm
place burning
near ash_meadow
hold shoulder_peek
await shoulder 3
weather clear:0:wind=0.5
wait 3.0
perf blades
shot 03-burning-grass-dry with land:burning
weather ash:1:wind=0.5
wait 4.0
perf blades
shot 04-burning-grass-ash with land:burning
release shoulder_peek
weather rules
